{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "2CO",
  "chapter": 6,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.6.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "We then, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " co-workers ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "with him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", beseech ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "you",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " also that ye receive not the grace of God in vain.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.6.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "(For he saith, I have heard thee in a time accepted, and in the day of salvation have I succored thee: behold, now ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the accepted time; behold, now ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the day of salvation.)",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.6.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Giving no offense in any thing, that the ministry be not blamed:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.6.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But in all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "things",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " approving ourselves as the ministers of God, in much patience, in afflictions, in necessities, in distresses,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.6.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In stripes, in imprisonments, in tumults, in labors, in watchings, in fastings;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.6.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "By pureness, by knowledge, by long-suffering, by kindness, by the Holy Spirit, by love unfeigned,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.6.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "By the word of truth, by the power of God, by the armor of righteousness on the right hand and on the left,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.6.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "By honor and dishonor, by evil report and good report: as deceivers, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "yet",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " true;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.6.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As unknown, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "yet",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " well known; as dying, and behold, we live; as chastened, and not killed;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.6.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As sorrowful, yet always rejoicing; as poor, yet making many rich; as having nothing, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "yet",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " possessing all things.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.6.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "ye",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Corinthians, our mouth is open to you, our heart is enlarged.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.6.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ye are not straitened in us, but ye are straitened in your own bowels.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.6.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now for a recompense in the same (I speak as to ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "my",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " children,) be ye also enlarged.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.6.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be ye not unequally yoked together with unbelievers: for what fellowship hath righteousness with unrighteousness? and what communion hath light with darkness?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.6.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And what concord hath Christ with Belial? or what part hath he that believeth with an infidel?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.6.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And what agreement hath the temple of God with idols? for ye are the temple of the living God; as God hath said, I will dwell in them, and walk in ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "; and I will be their God, and they shall be my people.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.6.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore come out from among them, and be ye separate, saith the Lord, and touch not the unclean ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thing",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "; and I will receive you;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.6.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "I",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " will be a Father to you, and ye shall be my sons and daughters, saith the Lord Almighty.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
